<!-- The album detail page's heading: a markup SPAN PARAGRAPH whose one
     bold run scales to 1.6x the body size — sized for the album page's 200pt side column — display-weight presence with
     the size-specific hierarchy Apple uses for album titles (weight +
     scale as a set, not size alone). Compiled at comptime like the
     header and now-playing fragments; the label mirrors the visible
     title so assistive tech announces the heading by name. -->
<text label="{openAlbumTitle}"><span weight="bold" scale="1.6">{openAlbumTitle}</span></text>
